{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1751328000, "end_date": 1752019199, "month_true_total": 27, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:16:10 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199294200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198449286251", "personaname": "Terra TopSide", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198449286251/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 290, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 290, "last_played": 1665918255, "avatar": "9a9b3f2042a1a107b252de71a3f1b76bcdc93d34"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Si te lo pillas por menos de 10€ esta muy bien, aunque este muerto...\r\nPor lo demas, recuerda mas a un vermintide que a Left 4 dead.", "timestamp_created": 1751988759, "timestamp_updated": 1751988759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199263786", "author": {"steamid": "76561198271212352", "personaname": "Caslu.32", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ElCaslu99/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 191, "playtime_forever": 876, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 77, "last_played": 1780890910, "avatar": "6d8ea3c74ececf54671f27a80d50d7fbe414fc3c"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "desde mi punto de vista por mas que el juego haya recibido criticas a dia de hoy para jugarlo con amigos no esta tan mal, vendieron mucho humo igual por ser en parte algun que otro desarrollador del primer left 4 dead en su momento no se asemeja en lo mas minimo, pero full recomendado! solamente en ofertas ahora mismo hasta el 10 de julio 3 USD!", "timestamp_created": 1751956382, "timestamp_updated": 1751956382, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508196711540222168", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199235092", "author": {"steamid": "76561198859860943", "personaname": "Abaddón", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198859860943/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 6202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6202, "last_played": 1751651461, "avatar": "7103d5d78b5f4b4ddbc41bca8f6030131462958b"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Left4Dead2 pero con mods a lo Warframe", "timestamp_created": 1751923810, "timestamp_updated": 1751923810, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199142342", "author": {"steamid": "76561198323533052", "personaname": "CHIMPANSINI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198323533052/", "num_games_owned": 47, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1107, "last_played": 1752544080, "avatar": "68c21ddc42a5286ec3276b3d4d116106521fb784"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es u  juego muy bueno! La acción es frenética, el sistema de cartas agrega estrategia sin quitarle ritmo, y la variedad de infectados mantiene cada partida fresca. El diseño de niveles es sólido, y jugar con amigos es una experiencia brutalmente divertida.\n\nNo es perfecto: el matchmaking a veces falla, y los bots pueden ser medio dormidos, pero cuando el equipo funciona y la horda se viene encima, sentís esa adrenalina que solo pocos juegos pueden ofrecer.\n\nMe gustó especialmente cómo han trabajado el sistema de progreso y construcción de mazos. Le da una capa más táctica a un juego que, de por sí, ya se siente como una montaña rusa de acción.", "timestamp_created": 1751832873, "timestamp_updated": 1751832873, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508196711540222168", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199123190", "author": {"steamid": "76561198161542107", "personaname": "Trejo.", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198161542107/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 12860, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3332, "last_played": 1778385855, "avatar": "55acfc2fa29ca75912ea76e0ed2a0a97e0ba904e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "buen juego de zombies, tiene su complejidad con los mazos y las hordas en dificultades mas altas, un poco tedioso pero bastante bueno.", "timestamp_created": 1751818572, "timestamp_updated": 1751818572, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}